# Morningtide's Light: a token that is exiled ceases to exist (CR 111.7, 704.5d), so it is not among "those cards" that return. Bot1 exiles one of
# Bot2's Spirit tokens (from Lingering Souls) and its own Ornithopter; at the end step only the Ornithopter returns, tapped. Bot2 keeps the other Spirit.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Morningtide's Light
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Lingering Souls
Plains x12

